positive.prompt:
Compare these synthetic public document versions and show removed and added lines with one-based coordinates.

Use only this synthetic input:
{
  "beforeText": "A\nDelete\nB\nC",
  "afterText": "A\nB\nC\nAppend"
}

Check whether these synthetic document versions differ after supported line-ending normalization. The before text uses CRLF and the after text uses LF.

Use only this synthetic input:
{
  "beforeText": "A\r\nA\r\nB",
  "afterText": "A\nA\nB"
}

Build a requirement coverage checklist from these explicit IDs and supplied excerpts. Preserve source line references and do not certify that any requirement is satisfied.

Use only this synthetic input:
{
  "requirements": [
    {
      "id": "R-01",
      "text": "Include two references.",
      "mandatory": true
    },
    {
      "id": "R-02",
      "text": "Include a delivery schedule.",
      "mandatory": true
    }
  ],
  "evidence": [
    {
      "evidenceId": "E-01",
      "requirementId": "R-01",
      "excerpt": "Reference A; Reference B.",
      "sourceLabel": "Synthetic proposal",
      "sourceLineStart": 4,
      "sourceLineEnd": 5,
      "userAssessment": "addresses_requirement"
    }
  ]
}

Make an evidence checklist using exact case-sensitive requirement IDs. Show unreviewed evidence, an explicitly identified gap, conflicting assessments and any unmapped evidence separately.

Use only this synthetic input:
{
  "requirements": [
    {
      "id": "R-OPEN",
      "text": "Include a project schedule."
    },
    {
      "id": "R-GAP",
      "text": "Include a support plan."
    },
    {
      "id": "R-CONFLICT",
      "text": "Include a security plan."
    }
  ],
  "evidence": [
    {
      "evidenceId": "E-OPEN",
      "requirementId": "R-OPEN",
      "excerpt": "Schedule excerpt.",
      "sourceLabel": "Synthetic proposal",
      "userAssessment": "not_reviewed"
    },
    {
      "evidenceId": "E-GAP",
      "requirementId": "R-GAP",
      "excerpt": "Support plan omitted.",
      "sourceLabel": "Synthetic review",
      "userAssessment": "does_not_address_requirement"
    },
    {
      "evidenceId": "E-YES",
      "requirementId": "R-CONFLICT",
      "excerpt": "Security controls listed.",
      "sourceLabel": "Synthetic reviewer A",
      "userAssessment": "addresses_requirement"
    },
    {
      "evidenceId": "E-NO",
      "requirementId": "R-CONFLICT",
      "excerpt": "Required controls not addressed.",
      "sourceLabel": "Synthetic reviewer B",
      "userAssessment": "does_not_address_requirement"
    },
    {
      "evidenceId": "E-LOWER",
      "requirementId": "r-open",
      "excerpt": "Another schedule excerpt.",
      "sourceLabel": "Synthetic appendix",
      "userAssessment": "addresses_requirement"
    }
  ]
}
